# Vercel's upload ignore list.
#
# This file must exist. Without it the CLI falls back to .gitignore, which
# excludes public/video/ — and the explainer video would be missing from the
# deployment while everything appeared to work locally.
#
# So: the usual build junk, but NOT public/video/.
node_modules
.vite
*.local
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo
.env*
.git
docs
scripts
